      "source": "https://ndg.ca/en/component/content/article/27-ndg-en-histoires?Itemid=45",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In August 2022, NDG en histoires launched its first historical walking tour during NDG Arts Week.",
